(7028417, 1066643, 100831, '<td valign="top">i feel the sun, the breeze... a breath of springtime.</td>', 'i feel the sun, the breeze... a breath of springtime.', '2013-04-28 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028422, 1066463, 100831, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying this way more than the usual magnolia picture. and I love magnolias.</td>', 'I''m enjoying this way more than the usual magnolia picture. and I love magnolias.', '2013-04-28 21:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028461, 1066351, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Absolutely beautiful! Love the soft pinks of the blossoms that contrast with the springtime blue of the sky. Composition is also great with the main branch of the blossom cutting across the frame at a diagonal. BTW, little jealous that you got to see the cherry blossoms full bloom glory as that they were still in the bud stage when I was visiting out in D.C.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Absolutely beautiful! Love the soft pinks of the blossoms that contrast with the springtime blue of the sky. Composition is also great with the main branch of the blossom cutting across the frame at a diagonal. BTW, little jealous that you got to see the cherry blossoms full bloom glory as that they were still in the bud stage when I was visiting out in D.C.', '2013-04-28 22:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028477, 1065462, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the soft pastels of the pink flowers. The bokeh really compliments the composition for it projects the feeling of downy softness of the flowers and a soft breeze. Great detail on the petals of the flower in the foreground.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the soft pastels of the pink flowers. The bokeh really compliments the composition for it projects the feeling of downy softness of the flowers and a soft breeze. Great detail on the petals of the flower in the foreground.', '2013-04-28 22:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028499, 1066581, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love those bold yellows that pop of the blue-green background. That pretty yellow, spring flower does take center stage in this photo. This just sings Springtime!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love those bold yellows that pop of the blue-green background. That pretty yellow, spring flower does take center stage in this photo. This just sings Springtime!', '2013-04-28 22:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028509, 1066614, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Absolutely love the light that brushes on the daisy and the green leaves. The cascade of bokeh rain is a really nice touch for it captures the essence of the saying "April showers bring May flowers." Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Absolutely love the light that brushes on the daisy and the green leaves. The cascade of bokeh rain is a really nice touch for it captures the essence of the saying "April showers bring May flowers." Nicely done.', '2013-04-28 22:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028521, 1066466, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Look how incredibly happy that dog just frolics in the field of flowers!!! Love the motion capture of the one paw in the air ready to skip and the airborne ears. B&amp;W tones are excellent. Great capture but I also wonder how stunning this looks in color.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Look how incredibly happy that dog just frolics in the field of flowers!!! Love the motion capture of the one paw in the air ready to skip and the airborne ears. B&W tones are excellent. Great capture but I also wonder how stunning this looks in color.', '2013-04-28 22:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028536, 1066374, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful colors and great details in the tulips and the soft blue sky with clouds. Great point of view where it projects the idea that the flowers tower over us as we look up at their springtime beauty.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful colors and great details in the tulips and the soft blue sky with clouds. Great point of view where it projects the idea that the flowers tower over us as we look up at their springtime beauty.', '2013-04-28 22:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028550, 1065572, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice bold hues of orange and yellow on this flower (fully open tulip?). You have captured some nice details in the texture of the petals. I think that this would shine even more if the backdrop had either a more springlike backdrop of some bokeh greens. Or even a black backdrop that would allow those brilliant hues to really pop visually. The grey background just doesn''t let it truly shine.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice bold hues of orange and yellow on this flower (fully open tulip?). You have captured some nice details in the texture of the petals. I think that this would shine even more if the backdrop had either a more springlike backdrop of some bokeh greens. Or even a black backdrop that would allow those brilliant hues to really pop visually. The grey background just doesn''t let it truly shine.', '2013-04-28 22:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028601, 1066650, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the point of view and the leading line that acts as a path through the rows of tulips:-) Nice bold reds, yellows and greens that really pop visually. Spring is here as we waltz through the tulips:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the point of view and the leading line that acts as a path through the rows of tulips:-) Nice bold reds, yellows and greens that really pop visually. Spring is here as we waltz through the tulips:-)', '2013-04-28 23:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028603, 1066329, 136989, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the beautiful pink is like cotton candy.</td>', 'I love the colors and the beautiful pink is like cotton candy.', '2013-04-28 23:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028615, 1066374, 136989, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely beautiful.  The intense blue sky and vibrant green leaves dotted with the flowers.  It looks surreal.  If I was a bug I definitely would want to live in this forest.  My favorite in this challenge for sure.</td>', 'This is absolutely beautiful.  The intense blue sky and vibrant green leaves dotted with the flowers.  It looks surreal.  If I was a bug I definitely would want to live in this forest.  My favorite in this challenge for sure.', '2013-04-29 00:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028617, 1066463, 136989, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  A gorgeous sea of pink and white all in wonderful detail.  I love the composition.</td>', 'Incredible.  A gorgeous sea of pink and white all in wonderful detail.  I love the composition.', '2013-04-29 00:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028733, 1066655, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the bokeh backdrop of soft colors of purple and greens. It really provides a nice spring stage to showcase the ladybug resting on the blossoming flower bud. Great details on the ladybug; legs are in sharp focus.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the bokeh backdrop of soft colors of purple and greens. It really provides a nice spring stage to showcase the ladybug resting on the blossoming flower bud. Great details on the ladybug; legs are in sharp focus.', '2013-04-29 05:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028844, 1066422, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The hills look lovely when the poppies blossom and blanket them during the spring. I think the one suggestion I have that would help improve this shot is to tone down the glamor or guassian blur layer for it adds too much softness &amp; glow that it takes away from the natural beauty.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The hills look lovely when the poppies blossom and blanket them during the spring. I think the one suggestion I have that would help improve this shot is to tone down the glamor or guassian blur layer for it adds too much softness & glow that it takes away from the natural beauty.', '2013-04-29 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028847, 1065819, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Great bokeh backdrop for these small delicate flowers to pop off of visually. This is a lovely shot but I think a closer crop would boost the visual appeal even more. Cropping to a square by shaving off 1/4 off the left would bring your audience closer to the delicate flowers to look at all the fine details &amp; texture in it''s petals.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Great bokeh backdrop for these small delicate flowers to pop off of visually. This is a lovely shot but I think a closer crop would boost the visual appeal even more. Cropping to a square by shaving off 1/4 off the left would bring your audience closer to the delicate flowers to look at all the fine details & texture in it''s petals.', '2013-04-29 10:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028849, 1065286, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>You have some beautiful budding flowers and the potential for great greens and reds but the lighting is preventing this composition from shining. The lighting is rather dark making the colors and composition feel dark and moody. Stereotypically Spring is about renewal with bright and cheery colors. I think if you had the opportunity to wait for some sunlight to shine upon these flowers it would help the composition. If that was not an option then some levels &amp; curves and mayhap perhaps a copy of the original layer in another layer set at Screen blend mode with low opacity would help brighten up the scene.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. You have some beautiful budding flowers and the potential for great greens and reds but the lighting is preventing this composition from shining. The lighting is rather dark making the colors and composition feel dark and moody. Stereotypically Spring is about renewal with bright and cheery colors. I think if you had the opportunity to wait for some sunlight to shine upon these flowers it would help the composition. If that was not an option then some levels & curves and mayhap perhaps a copy of the original layer in another layer set at Screen blend mode with low opacity would help brighten up the scene.', '2013-04-29 10:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028884, 1066600, 73942, '<td valign="top">beautiful, love your DOF, and such clarity here, not voting</td>', 'beautiful, love your DOF, and such clarity here, not voting', '2013-04-29 11:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028886, 1066514, 73942, '<td valign="top">the touch of red, just perfect, not voting</td>', 'the touch of red, just perfect, not voting', '2013-04-29 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7028890, 1066162, 108069, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and great message. Nice capture of a feeling. The vignette is maybe a little too intense in my feeble mind, but I completely understand what you''re after and drawing focus in the image.</td>', 'Nice perspective and great message. Nice capture of a feeling. The vignette is maybe a little too intense in my feeble mind, but I completely understand what you''re after and drawing focus in the image.', '2013-04-29 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
