(7029022, 1065751, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone''s hangin'' out in Hawaii!  As a fan of Lost, we really enjoyed visiting this spot a couple years back.</td>', 'Looks like someone''s hangin'' out in Hawaii!  As a fan of Lost, we really enjoyed visiting this spot a couple years back.', '2013-04-29 13:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029117, 1066329, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful light that showcased these flowers and great detail. Very much captures the springtime feeling. Boy do these flowers bring back memories of childhood. I remember picking them when they were in bloom in our backyard. Don''t know what they are called but they were very pretty.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful light that showcased these flowers and great detail. Very much captures the springtime feeling. Boy do these flowers bring back memories of childhood. I remember picking them when they were in bloom in our backyard. Don''t know what they are called but they were very pretty.', '2013-04-29 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029120, 1066536, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, what a great capture of momma and baby! Some great detail and texture in their feathers/fluff. Very cute - projects the idea of spring being the time of renewal and birth of little ones.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow, what a great capture of momma and baby! Some great detail and texture in their feathers/fluff. Very cute - projects the idea of spring being the time of renewal and birth of little ones.', '2013-04-29 17:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029125, 1065525, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment (and bump up a point:-) )<br/> <br/>They are soooo cute! Love the details and the great catchlights caught in these little ducklings eyes. Wonderful detail of the soft down on their bodies - I can almost reach out and feel the softness. My one suggestion is that I think that the composition would be even better if you cropped closer to bring your audience closer to those super cute duckling and trim away a bit more of that concrete ground that is just empty space.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment (and bump up a point:-) ) They are soooo cute! Love the details and the great catchlights caught in these little ducklings eyes. Wonderful detail of the soft down on their bodies - I can almost reach out and feel the softness. My one suggestion is that I think that the composition would be even better if you cropped closer to bring your audience closer to those super cute duckling and trim away a bit more of that concrete ground that is just empty space.', '2013-04-29 17:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029168, 1065462, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job on the depth of field.</td>', 'Great job on the depth of field.', '2013-04-29 18:16:29.000000', NULL, 1),
