(7029575, 1066642, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Those pretty and delicate blue flowers look like bells ringing in Spring:-) There are some nice details on the petals. Two suggestions I have that could improve the composition are cropping closer to bring your audience even closer to the beauty of these flowers and a higher aperture with faster shutter to further eliminate some/all of those blown highlights on the petals.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Those pretty and delicate blue flowers look like bells ringing in Spring:-) There are some nice details on the petals. Two suggestions I have that could improve the composition are cropping closer to bring your audience even closer to the beauty of these flowers and a higher aperture with faster shutter to further eliminate some/all of those blown highlights on the petals.', '2013-04-30 10:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
