(7029998, 1066251, 93283, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Nice detail and color. Given the portrait orientation it is a lot to take in so the speed voters may ding you for that. I happen to like it! 7</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Nice detail and color. Given the portrait orientation it is a lot to take in so the speed voters may ding you for that. I happen to like it! 7', '2013-04-30 21:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
