(7030177, 1066226, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ciaeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful birds!  The lines in the water create highlights that are a bit distracting. Especially as they really mess with your reflections. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the intense critique. I respectfully disagree.  These reflections are real life.  In the real world, reflections are not always mirror-like.  No highlights are blown out.  Sometimes, mirror reflections distract from the subject(s).  Anyway, I''m sorry you didn''t like my presentation.  I liked it very much.</td>', 'Originally posted by ciaeagle: Beautiful birds!  The lines in the water create highlights that are a bit distracting. Especially as they really mess with your reflections.  Thanks for the intense critique. I respectfully disagree.  These reflections are real life.  In the real world, reflections are not always mirror-like.  No highlights are blown out.  Sometimes, mirror reflections distract from the subject(s).  Anyway, I''m sorry you didn''t like my presentation.  I liked it very much.', '2013-05-01 01:27:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7030179, 1066685, 68504, '<td valign="top">Iolanthe.</td>', 'Iolanthe.', '2013-05-01 01:28:15.000000', NULL, 0),
