(7030306, 1066524, 138630, '<td valign="top">So sorry I didn''t get back to bump that one more time or to comment - I''m on vacation and a laptop so time and viewing speed and image quality (on this monitor) all conspired to keep me from doing a last run through.  This was my stand-alone favorite, however, and I gave it a 9 my first time through which I almost never do.  Thanks so much for the notes and congrats on a fine result - the image itself, not the finish in the challenge :)</td>', 'So sorry I didn''t get back to bump that one more time or to comment - I''m on vacation and a laptop so time and viewing speed and image quality (on this monitor) all conspired to keep me from doing a last run through.  This was my stand-alone favorite, however, and I gave it a 9 my first time through which I almost never do.  Thanks so much for the notes and congrats on a fine result - the image itself, not the finish in the challenge :)', '2013-05-01 09:55:14.000000', NULL, 0),
