(7030442, 1066524, 140305, '<td valign="top">Hi Jenn,<br/> <br/>I did something similar to this in the 30 second exposure challenge, only thing is I only had to move the hands on a clock. I tried mine in a completely darkened room and was working with a flashlight. It took many tries to get it right so I can appreciate how much effort went in to making this look as great as it does. Good on you for posting your thread, sometimes I wonder how certain effects are done and since this is a place to learn and grow, I''m glad your shared your technique.</td>', 'Hi Jenn, I did something similar to this in the 30 second exposure challenge, only thing is I only had to move the hands on a clock. I tried mine in a completely darkened room and was working with a flashlight. It took many tries to get it right so I can appreciate how much effort went in to making this look as great as it does. Good on you for posting your thread, sometimes I wonder how certain effects are done and since this is a place to learn and grow, I''m glad your shared your technique.', '2013-05-01 13:23:01.000000', NULL, 0),
